{"2715860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Ogi: Cycles", "steam_appid": 2715860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the moments, take it at your own pace, delve into mysteries, listen to the sounds of the wind and spot birds and creatures on your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome, curious stranger, to the world of Mullar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come, sit by the fire - you came just in time for the gathering. I would prepare some tasty berry juice, but the berries are gone.. Because of the storms. And so, I’m afraid, is half of our tribe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was so peaceful and cozy.. And suddenly, it wasn’t anymore. Suddenly, it was all chaos. We don’t know why or how. We just know.. That we miss our friends. I bet they’re lonely out there.. Lonely and story-less. If the storms keep coming, I think we will run out of stories, too.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tonight, the Elder will share a tale. A dark, important one. About when The Ogi arrived - and led us into chaos. That one, it scares me. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, legends aren’t true. .. They aren’t, are they?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=776 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big mysteries!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why the berries in Bushberry Forest have grown old, when they should be ripe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out why many of your tribe have disappeared!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the lost voice of Mullar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and beautiful world, filled with mystery, history, interesting creatures and life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your totem guide you through puzzles, unique places and a rich emotional story! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on any device you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit by the campfire and weather the storm with other players!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a carefully crafted world full of secrets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the world, from drawings, fellow Mullerkin and other ancient creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be curious and gather knowledge, through clues and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the hidden legacy and culture of Mullar</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the moments, take it at your own pace, delve into mysteries, listen to the sounds of the wind and spot birds and creatures on your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intro</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome, curious stranger, to the world of Mullar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come, sit by the fire - you came just in time for the gathering. I would prepare some tasty berry juice, but the berries are gone.. Because of the storms. And so, I’m afraid, is half of our tribe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was so peaceful and cozy.. And suddenly, it wasn’t anymore. Suddenly, it was all chaos. We don’t know why or how. We just know.. That we miss our friends. I bet they’re lonely out there.. Lonely and story-less. If the storms keep coming, I think we will run out of stories, too.. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tonight, the Elder will share a tale. A dark, important one. About when The Ogi arrived - and led us into chaos. That one, it scares me. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, legends aren’t true. .. They aren’t, are they?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=776 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/a14ef743ff5c3d5b5691e85122bf599d.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Big mysteries!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why the berries in Bushberry Forest have grown old, when they should be ripe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out why many of your tribe have disappeared!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for the lost voice of Mullar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=800 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/bdaf5b54d06565cdd23125906968226a.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and beautiful world, filled with mystery, history, interesting creatures and life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your totem guide you through puzzles, unique places and a rich emotional story! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on any device you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit by the campfire and weather the storm with other players!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.poster.avif?t=1786133596\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.webm?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/extras/17f146c4e22041cbd37d99ef4f3aebb0.mp4?t=1786133596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a carefully crafted world full of secrets! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about the world, from drawings, fellow Mullerkin and other ancient creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be curious and gather knowledge, through clues and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the hidden legacy and culture of Mullar</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Ogi - Cycles is a story about a little creature solving a big mystery. Uncover old stories and discover wonderful places. Break into another world, seek the wisdom of the Giants and learn the secrets of Mullar to uncover the truth about the storms, rotten berries, and your disappearing kin.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715860/2bc58088fa80b838aabcbf9a41fd6de08be608b9/header.jpg?t=178